83	542,851,1111,1650	83. Linden.	A Linden or Basswood shoot with alternate, heart-shaped, toothed leaves, their veins branching off from the ribs and joining into a fine network.
84	1134,852,1666,1655	84. Maple.	A Maple shoot with opposite, lobed and toothed leaves on long stalks, the finer meshes of netted veins drawn in one or two of the leaves.
